  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Health Emergency Response in DRC (SHER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support to government-led efforts to improve preparedness for, and response to, high-risk communicable disease outbreaks in the DRC. The project will strengthen the resilience of the health system and support a comprehensive and early response to high-risk outbreaks, averting costly socioeconomic impacts and reducing risks to national and global health security.</narrative>
  </description>
